<title>USA: Wallace acquires commercial printer.</title>
<headline>Wallace acquires commercial printer.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wallace Computer Services Inc Wednesday said it has acquired  Post Printing Inc, a commercial printer in West Bend, Wisconsin with annual sales of about $8 million.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Business forms company Wallace said the acquisition will be handled as a cash transaction and that it expects the purchase to be additive to fiscal 1997 earnings.</p>
<p>Wallace shares were up 1/4 at 29.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
